{"id":"n27855-1-7","stage":4,"title":"골칫거리 · 难题","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n27855-1-7-1","ko":"오늘도 주차 장소 찾으려고 시간이 너무 많이 걸렸어.","zh":"今天找停车位又花了太多时间呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘도","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘도","audio":"/audio/77d25b815bea9e75c627.mp3"}},{"text":"주차","meaning":"停车，停放车辆","explanation":"주차：停车，停放车辆。","readings":[{"term":"주차","audio":"/audio/402473b26294876f2ebe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25986","senseId":"1","lemma":"주차","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주차","audio":"/audio/402473b26294876f2ebe.mp3"}},{"text":"장소","meaning":"场所，地点","explanation":"장소：场所，地点。","readings":[{"term":"장소","audio":"/audio/61eaecc09cb7e53dbc6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30185","senseId":"1","lemma":"장소","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"장소","audio":"/audio/61eaecc09cb7e53dbc6e.mp3"}},{"text":"찾으려고","meaning":"找，追求，谋求","explanation":"찾다：找，追求，谋求；으려고：表示意图或打算：“想要、打算”。","readings":[{"term":"찾다","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57320","senseId":"7","lemma":"찾다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찾으려고","audio":"/audio/f71369c6940989978e1b.mp3"}},{"text":"시간이","meaning":"时间","explanation":"시간：时间；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62841","senseId":"4","lemma":"시간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시간이","audio":"/audio/cecaa2f0353f97459090.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太。","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多。","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"걸렸어.","meaning":"花费，消耗","explanation":"걸리다：花费，消耗；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"걸리다","audio":"/audio/d94590a358564fb83462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86940","senseId":"21","lemma":"걸리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걸렸어","audio":"/audio/9626e6e98ea5b22d2e28.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"402473b26294876f","term":"주차","zh":"停车，停放车辆","audio":"/audio/402473b26294876f2ebe.mp3","entryId":"25986","definition":"把汽车等停在一定的地方。","pronunciation":["주ː차"]},{"id":"61eaecc09cb7e53d","term":"장소","zh":"场所，地点","audio":"/audio/61eaecc09cb7e53dbc6e.mp3","entryId":"30185","definition":"某事发生的地方；或指进行某事的地方。","pronunciation":["장소"]},{"id":"0aa19509314fd879","term":"찾다","zh":"找，追求，谋求","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3","entryId":"57320","definition":"寻求某物。","pronunciation":["찯따"]},{"id":"4692cef5ac69eb37","term":"시간","zh":"时间","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3","entryId":"62841","definition":"某件事从开始到结束的间隔期间。","pronunciation":["시간"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"d94590a358564fb8","term":"걸리다","zh":"花费，消耗","audio":"/audio/d94590a358564fb83462.mp3","entryId":"86940","definition":"需要消磨时间。","pronunciation":["걸리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/419b917032adff728381.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n27855-1-7-2","ko":"주차 공간 부족은 우리 동네의 골칫거리야.","zh":"停车位不足是我们这个社区的麻烦事。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"주차","meaning":"停车，停放车辆","explanation":"주차：停车，停放车辆。","readings":[{"term":"주차","audio":"/audio/402473b26294876f2ebe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25986","senseId":"1","lemma":"주차","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주차","audio":"/audio/402473b26294876f2ebe.mp3"}},{"text":"공간","meaning":"场所","explanation":"공간：场所。","readings":[{"term":"공간","audio":"/audio/a664be21489449336498.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18694","senseId":"3","lemma":"공간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공간","audio":"/audio/a664be21489449336498.mp3"}},{"text":"부족은","meaning":"不足，缺乏，不够","explanation":"부족：不足，缺乏，不够；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"부족","audio":"/audio/da5d28ca3f995c9da599.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59843","senseId":"1","lemma":"부족","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부족은","audio":"/audio/703dc1ed49ec1653a086.mp3"}},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"동네의","meaning":"小区，社区，村庄","explanation":"동네：小区，社区，村庄；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"동네","audio":"/audio/f97ccdfe641c28373e6c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62417","senseId":"2","lemma":"동네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"동네의","audio":"/audio/fceff33aca6e0b016fa9.mp3"}},{"text":"골칫거리야.","meaning":"难题，让人头疼的事","explanation":"골칫거리：难题，让人头疼的事；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"골칫거리","audio":"/audio/59ec1e983005f8d1d6bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27855","senseId":"1","lemma":"골칫거